      "type": "mcq",
      "question": "Marcus pays Rs. 1,000 to Toby with Rs. 50, Rs. 20 and Rs. 10 notes. If the total number of notes given is 40 and the number of Rs. 20 notes is 8, find the number of Rs. 50 notes in the payment",
      "options": [
        "10",
