        "13"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 3,
      "answerSource": "derived",
      "answerKeyRef": null,
      "explanation": "Eight Rs.20 notes contribute Rs.160. Let x be the number of Rs.50 notes; the remaining 32−x notes are Rs.10 notes. Then 50x + 10(32−x) + 160 = 1000, giving 40x = 520 and x = 13. Check: 13 + 8 + 19 = 40 notes and 650 + 160 + 190 = 1000. Verified solution (unofficial); original printed paper and worked derivation checked on 26 October 2026.",
